Subject: Compile complete original NL print and isolated Wii16 MSL formatter with native ABI
Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Keep the Matching NL wrapper body, including final-byte termination and the
original nlVSNPrintf(size-1) rule. Adapt underlying host formatting aliasing,
real native va_list/size/integer types, original Wii16 wchar data, C linkage,
PPC count-leading-zero and BE IEEE-double reads. Original MSL format parsing,
conversion, locale, writing and truncation flow remains in prepared source.
This is not a font readiness or full game link claim.

